---
// AboutSection.astro - Short about section with lavender-to-teal gradient background
---

<section class="relative py-8 md:py-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-accent-lavender)] to-[var(--color-surface)]" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,58,239,0.1)_0%,rgba(20,184,166,0.1)_100%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,transparent_50%,rgba(0,0,0,0.05)_100%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  
  <div class="section-container relative z-10 text-center">
    <h2 id="about-title" class="section-title mb-6">About Otaku Blitz</h2>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed text-balance">
        Otaku Blitz is a lightweight, static anime quiz playground built with Astro. No databases, no sign-ups, no friction — just pure anime gaming fun. Challenge yourself with Description, Zoomed Image, and Colour Guessing games across your favorite series.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed text-balance">
        Your progress saves locally. Your best scores compete globally. New questions added daily by the community.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
